---
description: Prefer local main; never push unless the user asks
alwaysApply: true
---

# Main branch workflow

1. Do completed work on local `main` (or merge into local `main` when finishing a feature branch). Fast-forward preferred.
2. Do **not** push to `origin` unless the user explicitly asks (push / publish / задеплой / запушь).
3. Do **not** open a PR unless the user explicitly asks for one.

Git safety still applies: no force-push to `main`, no `--no-verify`, no amending others' commits.
